WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1: In HubSpot, open Development in the left menu.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Step 2: Open Keys, then Service Keys.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Click Create service key in the top right.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Name it RevOps Workshop. The name must be unique in your account.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 5: Click Add new scope. Add read and write for crm.objects.contacts, crm.objects.deals, crm.schemas.contacts and crm.schemas.deals.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Step 6: Check the list holds those eight, click Create, then confirm in the dialog.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Step 7: Open the key, click Show, then Copy. It starts pat-. Paste it into your centre.
